WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.501
-Today is Friday.

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:05.167
I call it "Fri-yay."

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:06.367
-Fri-yay.
-Yeah.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.100
-I call it Fri-Fri,
but either way,

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.300
I always have to write,

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.734
I have to catch up with
some personal stuff.

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:11.968
I have to write out
some thank you notes,

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:13.200
so right now,
if you don't mind,

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.834
can I write them out
in the middle of the show?

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:16.434
[ Applause ]
I'm sorry.

00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:19.901
James, can I get some thank you
note writing music, please?

00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:21.534
[ Gentle piano music plays ]

00:00:21.534 --> 00:00:23.334
Ooh, he's ready for the weekend.
-Oh, man.

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:25.834
-He's ready for the weekend.
-Mr. Friday Night.

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:28.901
-No tie.

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:31.334
-Thank's how you get ready
for the weekend?

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.901
-Yeah, he takes his tie off
and just goes for it, man.

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:36.634
Boop.

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:39.334
Thank you, Indy 500 drivers,

00:00:39.334 --> 00:00:41.868
for drinking milk
after the race,

00:00:41.868 --> 00:00:44.601
which, thanks to inflation,
is basically champagne,

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:46.033
so there you guys go.

00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:48.901
[ Applause ]

00:00:51.667 --> 00:00:55.901
Thank you,
American flag toothpicks,

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.067
for making it look like

00:00:57.067 --> 00:00:59.000
the moon landing
happened on my hamburger.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.834
[ Applause ]

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:06.934
That's one small --
-Bun for man.

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:10.133
-Thank you, the series finale
of "This is Us"

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:12.601
for not being called
"That Was We."

00:01:12.601 --> 00:01:14.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.367 --> 00:01:18.467
That was...

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:24.400
Thank you, White Claw's
new line of drinks

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.434
called "White Claw Refrshrs,"

00:01:26.434 --> 00:01:30.868
for being low in calories,
carbs, and vowels, apparently.

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:33.501
[ Applause ]

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:37.701
[ Chuckles ]

00:01:37.701 --> 00:01:41.167
Thank you,
graduation caps and dunce caps,

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.067
for measuring intelligence
by hat pointiness.

00:01:44.067 --> 00:01:46.901
[ Applause ]

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.901
[ Chuckles ] Dunce caps.

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:54.434
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:54.434 --> 00:01:56.701
Thank you, croquet mallets,

00:01:56.701 --> 00:01:58.234
for showing me what it
would look like

00:01:58.234 --> 00:02:00.534
if Thor joined a country club.

00:02:00.534 --> 00:02:02.934
[ Applause ]

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.534
[ Laughing ]

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:09.934
Thank you, backyard barbecues,

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:12.901
for being like the Met Gala
of dads wearing aprons.

00:02:12.901 --> 00:02:14.601
There you go.

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.200
[ Applause ]

00:02:20.501 --> 00:02:23.234
Thank you, crosswalk timer,

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:25.534
for looking like a countdown
to a high-five.

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:26.701
There you have it, everybody.

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:28.300
Those are our thank you notes!

